{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は\n沈黙の金曜日聴いてくださって\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/08/1359083/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4回目ではあるけど\n2週あいてしまったのですよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/08/1359083/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご無沙汰しております"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観覧来てくださった方々、ありがとう！\nまた天気悪くてごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/08/1359083/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モーニング娘。'16さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/08/1359083/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"譜久村聖さん、石田亜佑美さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても緊張しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/08/1359083/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDいただいてしまいました！！\n大事にします！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今回\n2ndアルバム『それぞれの椅子』に収録されてる\nえりか様のソロ曲『低体温のキス』を\n初解禁しちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/08/1359083/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外な曲でびっくりだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん聴いてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/08/1359083/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日9日の20時から\nゆったんのラジオ おに魂で\n『欲望のリインカーネーション』\n解禁しちゃうよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田もまだ完成を聴いてないんです～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/08/1359083/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どきどき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BbyB."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/08/1359083/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『nendo』さんがデザインした限定パッケージです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめん、今年のバレンタインの限定ものなんだけども…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『BbyB.』って\n正方形の洗練されたパッケージに\n5個同じ味のチョコが入っていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがいろんな種類あって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってイメージだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは10種類 別の味が入ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味を食レポするよりも\n10種類何の味なのかをあげた方が\n豊富さを感じてもらえたり\n興味をもってもらえる気がするので\n書きますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#05 ダークチョコレート/チェリー/レモン\n#08 ミルクチョコレート/シュペキュロース/オレンジ\n#15 ミルクチョコレート / バベリュット / ヘーゼルナッツ\n#27 ダークチョコレート/スターアニス/ハニー\n#48 ダークチョコレート/ジンジャー\n#56 ダークチョコレート / 柚子 / わさび\n#58 ダークチョコレート/バベリュット/シーソルト\n#64 ホワイトチョコレート / ラズベリー 